  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is (where <math><mi>C</mi></math> is the constant of integration)",
    "image": null
  },
